<https://w3id.org/smtg/id/printing/906e1087-e6e3-452b-a73f-b3bc1506d67b/face/0/printed-text> smtg:textValue "Il Fulmine infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio."@it;
    smtg:textLanguage <https://w3id.org/smtg/vocab/language/it>.
<https://w3id.org/smtg/id/printing/906e1087-e6e3-452b-a73f-b3bc1506d67b/face/0/flavor-text> a smtg:FlavorText.
